Acad Sci</source><year>2000</year><volume>902</volume><fpage>249</fpage><lpage>262</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Ann NY Acad Sci||902|249||bib7|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Claffey</surname><given-names>KP</given-names></name><name><surname>Wilkison</surname><given-names>WO</given-names></name><name><surname>Spiegelman</surname><given-names>BM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Vascular endothelial growth factor: regulation by cell differentiation and activated second messenger pathways</article-title><source>J Biol Chem</source><year>1992</year><volume>267</volume><fpage>16317</fpage><lpage>16322</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Biol Chem||267|16317||bib8|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1644816</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Compagni</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Christofori</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Recent advances in research on multistage tumorigenesis</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>2000</year><volume>83</volume><fpage>1</fpage><lpage>5</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Br J Cancer||83|1||bib9|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib10"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Connolly</surname><given-names>DT</given-names></name><name><surname>Heuvelman</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Nelson</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Olander</surname><given-names>JV</given-names></name><name><surname>Eppley</surname><given-names>BL</given-names></name><name><surname>Delfino</surname><given-names>JJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Siegel</surname><given-names>NR</given-names></name><name><surname>Leimgruber</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Feder</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Tumor vascular permeability factor stimulates endothelial cell growth and angiogenesis</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><year>1989</year><volume>84</volume><fpage>1470</fpage><lpage>1478</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'J Clin Invest||84|1470||bib10|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2478587</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>D'Amato</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Loughnan</surname><given-names>MS</given-names></name><name><surname>Flynn</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Folkman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Thalidomide is an inhibitor of angiogenesis</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci USA</source><year>1994</year><volume>91</volume><fpage>4082</fpage><lpage>4085</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Proc Natl Acad Sci USA||91|4082||bib11|'--></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dankbar</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Padro</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Leo</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Feldmann</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>Kropff</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mesters</surname><given-names>RM</given-names></name><name><surname>Serve</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Berdel</surname><given-names>WE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kienast</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Vascular endothelial growth factor and interleukin-6 in paracrine tumor- stromal cell interactions in multiple myeloma</article-title><source>Blood</source><year>2000</year><volume>95</volume><fpage>2630</fpage><lpage>2636</